Cell["\<\
Figure 4.1  Arctic tern \[LongDash] monthly population centroid on the \
Atlantic-basin flyway, orthographic globe over relief. Numbers mark the \
calendar month; the track sweeps from southern winter quarters up to \
high-Arctic breeding latitudes and back.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"b7d3efc3-34e9-4d2d-b94b-80da42ead00e"],

